<title>POLAND: POLIFARB SEEKS TO RE-START PRODUCTION.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB SEEKS TO RE-START PRODUCTION.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish paintmaker Polifarb Wroclaw, suspended from Warsaw bourse trade since July 14 due to flooding, is preparing to re-start production and assess flood damage, the firm said in a statement on Friday.</p>
<p>Polifarb said it was continuing sales from inventory.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
